{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control both airplanes</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622300/extras/f77455c0e2a4b4ab8894d871cb741cab.poster.avif?t=1771233063\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622300/extras/f77455c0e2a4b4ab8894d871cb741cab.webm?t=1771233063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622300/extras/f77455c0e2a4b4ab8894d871cb741cab.mp4?t=1771233063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experience the thrill of handling two aircraft simultaneously. Whether you prefer the precision of a keyboard or the intuitive feel of a gamepad, you'll be able to master the skies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Co-op and Steam Remote Play </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622300/extras/795329fb227a2941639bfde36ccf9b7d.poster.avif?t=1771233063\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622300/extras/795329fb227a2941639bfde36ccf9b7d.webm?t=1771233063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622300/extras/795329fb227a2941639bfde36ccf9b7d.mp4?t=1771233063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Team up with a friend and enjoy the excitement of local co-op gameplay, or take advantage of Steam's Remote Play to connect with friends from around the world. Coordinate your strategies, support each other in battle, and dominate the enemy forces together.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Altitudes of Combat</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s